{"indicator":{"caveat":{"en":"Turnout is the share of those entitled to vote who voted, and who is entitled differs between the two elections: in municipal elections foreign citizens registered in Sweden for three years may also vote, which is not true of the general election. The series has one value per election year and nothing in between. The figure counts a voter where they are registered as resident, not where the vote was cast.","sv":"Valdeltagandet avser andelen av de röstberättigade som röstade, och vem som är röstberättigad skiljer sig mellan valen: i kommunfullmäktigval röstar även utländska medborgare som varit folkbokförda i Sverige i tre år, vilket inte gäller riksdagsvalet. Serien har ett värde per valår och ingenting däremellan. Talet räknas där väljaren är folkbokförd, inte där rösten lades."},"coverage":{"from":1973,"to":2022,"years":[1973,1976,1979,1982,1985,1988,1991,1994,1998,2002,2006,2010,2014,2018,2022]},"derivation":"One SCB cell per municipality and election year. `regions: known` drops the table’s 291st four-digit code, `1229 Bara`, which was merged into Svedala in 1977 — this table starts in 1973, so the code is real history rather than an error.","description":{"en":"Share of those entitled to vote in the municipality who voted in the general election.","sv":"Andel av de röstberättigade i kommunen som röstade i riksdagsvalet."},"id":"turnout-general-election","name":{"en":"Turnout, general election","sv":"Valdeltagande i riksdagsval"},"priceBasis":"none","scale":{"breaks":[81.5,84.2,86,87.7,89.8,91.7],"kind":"sequential"},"sensitivity":"none","sources":[{"contentCode":"ME0104B8","note":"1973–2022, election years","table":"TAB2707"}],"unit":"percent"},"layout":{"circles":[{"code":"0114","r":11.61,"x":589.38,"y":633.88},{"code":"0115","r":12.32,"x":625.83,"y":665.77},{"code":"0117","r":12.17,"x":655.49,"y":673.43},{"code":"0120","r":12.32,"x":662.72,"y":700.99},{"code":"0123","r":12.26,"x":577.24,"y":681.2},{"code":"0125","r":12.77,"x":530